  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-03-31T17:39:23.717Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I think it would be great if there was a way to create a persisted world/room, any invites given in that world remain open and it would act like a group chat and/or have that specific instance be the home world for multiple people\nExisting trust setting should probably apply at the room level in case the creator isnt around\nAlso it would probably good to link this to a discord/twitch or other integration that has roles so the ability to invite, set home, trust levels can be associated to a role\nI think this would be a great way for people to extend their discord/twitch communities into VRC\nI dont think it would be needed to preserve the state of the room, but it might be good to have someone be able to reset it as currently the way to fix a room with broken widgets is to create a new one",
